WEBVTT

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:27.290
Wow, it sure is white in here.

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:34.800
Down we... go.

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:37.590
It's not painted white, though.

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:42.560
All these formulas and diagrams overlap
and form layers, making them look white.

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:46.680
He probably started out
writing them in black.

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:49.520
But once it was all black,
he began using white.

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:52.280
But even that wasn't enough,

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:55.530
and he added more and more clearboards
as time went on.

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:59.070
It's like... When I see all this,

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:02.620
each one starts to look like
a cry for help from Keith.

00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:07.830
Lily?

00:01:18.340 --> 00:01:22.970
What's the answer
that Keith's trying to find?

00:01:28.930 --> 00:01:31.980
SOUTHWESTERN CREMONA, MORTA ISLAND

00:02:28.360 --> 00:02:30.700
Why did you save me?

00:02:31.740 --> 00:02:34.540
There's a few more things
I want to ask you.

00:02:36.910 --> 00:02:40.250
But first, dig in.
We can talk about that afterwards.

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:48.270
Do you recognize this man?

00:02:52.010 --> 00:02:52.980
I do.

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:56.770
Dead Kyle, a serial killer.

00:02:57.390 --> 00:02:59.940
Also known as
the Raven-haired Murder Machine.

00:03:01.310 --> 00:03:06.780
And the man they claim
to be my little sister's killer.

00:03:07.610 --> 00:03:08.620
Claim to be?

00:03:15.950 --> 00:03:18.630
Is he what you wanted to ask me about?

00:03:19.210 --> 00:03:24.550
During his trial, he escaped from
the mental hospital he was being held at,

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:29.520
and as he was about to commit a new crime,
he was killed by parties unknown.

00:03:31.470 --> 00:03:32.100
This man wa-

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:34.690
I really don't care about the details.

00:03:36.140 --> 00:03:38.650
I know Kyle didn't kill my little sister.

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:42.650
How she was killed was different
from his other victims.

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:46.950
So why did he confess to murdering her?

00:03:48.440 --> 00:03:52.490
How did he know where she was killed
and where the murder weapon was?

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:54.710
How did he pass his polygraph?

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:57.080
Who was he covering for?

00:03:59.910 --> 00:04:01.420
And to start with,

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:04.880
who was Dead Kyle, anyway?

00:04:07.920 --> 00:04:10.800
You know who he is, don't you?

00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:14.680
Yes.

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:16.730
I know.

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:19.770
He was a Reggie who was released.

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:22.940
As you guessed, he's not human.

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:24.570
"Reggie"?

00:04:25.650 --> 00:04:30.080
A race of ancient demihumans
created solely to fight.

00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:35.080
He was one of the Reggies
who attacked the Institute that day.

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:40.540
I killed him.

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:47.340
So, Killer B's motive
was revenge all along. Well, well.

00:04:48.630 --> 00:04:51.720
Every single criminal you've killed
has been

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:55.390
a Reggie who took part in that attack,
haven't they?

00:04:57.720 --> 00:04:59.730
There was a burnt smell everywhere.

00:05:01.270 --> 00:05:05.980
That day, surrounded by ash and despair,
I swore a vow.

00:05:07.480 --> 00:05:12.990
I would kill every last one of them.
And I would find Yuna no matter what.

00:05:15.320 --> 00:05:16.460
And until I do,

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:20.580
I won't let anyone stand in my way,
I don't care who they are.

00:05:27.630 --> 00:05:30.090
Among the foot soldiers of Market Maker

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:33.890
exists a team whose sole mission
is manipulating social disorder,

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:38.060
based out of their flagship,
the Moby Dick.

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:41.850
They sometimes brainwash humans
to suit their purposes

00:05:41.850 --> 00:05:44.770
and it's said
you should never cross the group.

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:50.780
Letters deduced from a watch...

00:05:52.070 --> 00:05:54.160
J.H.R.

00:05:58.780 --> 00:06:01.960
The site hasn't been updated in a while.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:03.170
Oh, that!

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:04.460
Well,

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:08.840
I figured they might make contact
if I got their attention,

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:11.300
so I made up that website.

00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:15.470
I saw the watch.
It was Jean who attacked Bran, wasn't it?

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:17.050
Yeah.

00:06:17.050 --> 00:06:20.180
Keith, turn yourself in. It's not too...

00:06:20.180 --> 00:06:22.350
He's here. With me, right now.

00:06:23.180 --> 00:06:26.440
Killer B, you mean?
So contact was made after all.

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:31.530
Kyle isn't the person who killed Erika.
That's for certain.

00:06:32.690 --> 00:06:36.660
And just as I hypothesized,
it turns out he wasn't human.

00:06:38.820 --> 00:06:41.540
Even coming from you,
that's hard to believe.

00:06:43.120 --> 00:06:46.250
It won't be long. It'll be over soon.

00:06:48.120 --> 00:06:51.050
Everything that began
with me deciphering the inscription

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:54.010
is about to come to an end.

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:57.720
I'll finally get the answers.

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:03.400
We already have our answer.
We got it a long time ago.

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:11.450
You're letting the ends justify the means
and are starting to go off the rails.

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:12.530
Tell me I'm wrong.

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:19.040
Keith,
Bran almost got killed because of this.

00:07:19.740 --> 00:07:22.620
Anyway, come back in.
Let's work something out.

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:27.840
They're making their move, huh?

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:35.010
To take me out, they... Market Maker
has finally started to take action.

00:07:36.170 --> 00:07:37.180
Haven't they?

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:44.400
Did you even anticipate that, too?

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:50.400
Eric.

00:07:51.690 --> 00:07:52.860
Yes?

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:56.700
I really appreciate all you've done
for me.

00:07:57.360 --> 00:07:58.870
I wanted you to know.

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:01.450
Keith?

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:04.830
Keith! Please, wait! Keith!

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:11.750
It's begun.

00:08:27.010 --> 00:08:31.230
What's the big idea, asking me
to come here at the crack of dawn?

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:58.050
I don't know what you're doing,
but are you done?

00:09:01.300 --> 00:09:03.600
The red text written on the ceiling.

00:09:04.050 --> 00:09:06.690
It's the only complete
mathematical formula.

00:09:07.930 --> 00:09:11.770
I've re-entered them three times.
I thought it must be a mistake.

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:26.080
Boris.

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:31.670
Is this why Keith has always
kept his distance from me?

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:35.470
Who is this? You know, don't you?

00:09:37.670 --> 00:09:41.840
Is there some connection between
Keith's coming back and this person?

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:44.260
What is Keith trying to do?

00:09:46.010 --> 00:09:47.220
That girl...

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:50.270
During the winter eight years back,

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:53.360
her body was cut up
and dumped in the mountains.

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:56.110
She was Keith's little sister.

00:10:01.730 --> 00:10:07.580
So to reuse discarded Reggies,
that gold solution is necessary?

00:10:08.240 --> 00:10:11.960
It's used to adjust their testosterone
and dopamine levels.

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:15.550
There seem to be various kinds,
but I don't know much about it.

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:18.510
What causes them to be discarded?

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:24.180
Around age 20, Reggies lose control of
their powers and can't think rationally.

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:26.470
They're discarded
when they fall below a set value.

00:10:27.050 --> 00:10:30.430
And by "discarded,"
you mean released into society?

00:10:31.010 --> 00:10:31.980
Yeah.

00:10:32.720 --> 00:10:36.690
So, how many are there?
Grade-C goods like Kyle, I mean.

00:10:37.390 --> 00:10:38.440
There are lots.

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:43.410
This country is crawling with more
discarded Reggies than you can imagine.

00:10:44.360 --> 00:10:48.910
At a signal, they'll turn into frenzied
weapons, killing until they're put down.

00:10:48.910 --> 00:10:52.670
It's disguised as something else.
So although it's in plain sight,

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:55.920
-no one knows.
-Killing is the only way to stop them.

00:10:57.960 --> 00:10:59.740
I'm gonna buy some red bean buns.

00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:00.380
Huh?

00:11:13.140 --> 00:11:15.610
I'll answer
if it's about the investigation.

00:11:16.270 --> 00:11:19.490
I have issues with the direction
this investigation is taking.

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:21.740
I'm busy. Come back later.

00:11:23.860 --> 00:11:27.700
We could keep this up forever,
but I don't think we'll find Keith.

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:29.910
That's an order. Keep working.

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:30.880
I won't obey.

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:31.830
Then get out.

00:11:33.490 --> 00:11:37.000
You're hindering the investigation.
Leave your badge and get out.

00:11:38.290 --> 00:11:40.840
Didn't you hear me? You're suspended.

00:11:41.460 --> 00:11:44.720
I'm saying that I don't need fools
who can't obey orders.

00:11:45.380 --> 00:11:46.680
Get out right now.

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:51.970
Die, you four-eyed chin with legs! Jerk!

00:11:51.970 --> 00:11:55.180
Everybody in the RIS calls you that! Jerk!

00:11:58.310 --> 00:12:01.150
Eric. Lily's on the move.

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:05.530
Are you sure this is a good idea?
I'm worried.

00:12:05.980 --> 00:12:08.450
The RIS is
under Market Maker surveillance.

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:13.040
This is our only option
to get ahead of them.

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:18.040
Yeah, but I'm worried
Lily might get caught in the crossfire.

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:20.540
Boris, the girl is a professional.

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:26.000
I'm sure you've noticed
that Lily and Keith are very similar.

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:31.300
Their thought process. Their insight.
Their drive. Their inquiring minds.

00:12:31.880 --> 00:12:35.930
The reason I scouted Lily for the RIS
over everyone's objections

00:12:36.470 --> 00:12:39.770
is that deep down,
her abilities are equal to Keith's.

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:41.860
Because I sensed that in her.

00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:43.320
And...

00:12:44.060 --> 00:12:48.070
Boris, if Keith doesn't want to be found,
I can't find him.

00:12:49.070 --> 00:12:50.910
I'm betting on Lily.

00:12:53.450 --> 00:12:54.450
Understood.

00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:10.420
Kaela, are you done?

00:13:10.420 --> 00:13:11.430
Almost there.

00:13:12.550 --> 00:13:13.680
Okay, all done!

00:13:23.810 --> 00:13:25.110
Are we secure now?

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:29.070
I don't know. But I think
this will keep them out for a while.

00:13:32.530 --> 00:13:35.040
Here. This red line is Lily, right?

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:37.950
Who tagged her car?

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:39.330
Boris did it.

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:41.670
She's gonna be upset when she finds out.

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:45.880
I had to do it. I don't think she has
what it takes to keep up an act.

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:47.420
Yeah, probably not.

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:49.840
-Because she's an idiot.
-Because she's an idiot.

00:14:23.200 --> 00:14:25.080
I want a red bean bun.

00:14:28.790 --> 00:14:31.260
I don't have any leads.

00:14:31.880 --> 00:14:34.680
It's the same thing everywhere I look.

00:14:35.300 --> 00:14:39.310
If it's all the same,
I should've gone someplace with good food.

00:14:44.810 --> 00:14:47.900
The smell of those spices
with the funny taste...

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:04.840
HOLS ISLAND

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:11.960
How did you know that blue steel
was the Reggies' weakness?

00:15:13.250 --> 00:15:15.260
Same as you.

00:15:16.050 --> 00:15:17.720
My father's journal.

00:15:22.470 --> 00:15:25.150
How long do you plan
to wander around aimlessly?

00:15:27.600 --> 00:15:29.900
There's nothing aimless about it.

00:15:30.270 --> 00:15:33.280
We're hitting up towns
that have good places to eat.

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:34.530
I said "how long"?

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:36.610
Until your body is back at 100%.

00:15:37.190 --> 00:15:40.250
If you're gonna complain,
rub one out and go to sleep.

00:15:45.990 --> 00:15:48.500
You seem pretty much recovered to me.

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:51.260
It seems like you're ready to fight.

00:15:52.420 --> 00:15:55.720
I'm guessing you have an ulterior motive
for saving me.

00:15:56.550 --> 00:15:57.550
Answer me.

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:03.270
There's something I want your help with.

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:06.860
There's no reason for me to help you.

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:07.900
There is.

00:16:08.180 --> 00:16:10.860
Would you mind getting this
out of my face?

00:16:11.190 --> 00:16:12.110
It's in the way.

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:22.870
Now, I want an explanation.

00:16:23.990 --> 00:16:27.080
I've been investigating two men
for a long time.

00:16:27.410 --> 00:16:29.840
That's why I got back into the field.

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:33.800
I needed to see everything
with my own two eyes.

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:39.390
She's almost to Hols Island.

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:42.560
Can't imagine Keith would be
in a place like that.

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:46.480
It's nothing but old men and women,
and a handful of tourist traps.

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:49.980
I think Keith would stand out
if he set foot outside.

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:54.230
Kaela, make arrangements for a chopper.

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:59.660
I've spent a long, long time
looking into them.

00:16:59.900 --> 00:17:02.570
But no matter how deep I dig,

00:17:02.570 --> 00:17:05.620
clues that seem made up
get in the way of the answer.

00:17:06.160 --> 00:17:07.160
In the way?

00:17:07.410 --> 00:17:08.410
Yeah.

00:17:08.990 --> 00:17:12.090
The first is "the possibility
of non-humans."

00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:14.880
The existence of you guys, basically.

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:16.840
You aren't getting it,

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:18.160
but Yuna and I aren't Reggies, so-

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:19.840
I'm starving.

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:22.310
Let's go grab something to eat.

00:17:25.760 --> 00:17:26.770
What else?

00:17:27.180 --> 00:17:30.230
Before I get to that,
let me ask you something.

00:17:30.720 --> 00:17:33.230
Was Yuna the Yuna you remembered?

00:17:36.440 --> 00:17:38.440
She wasn't. Not at first.

00:17:39.480 --> 00:17:40.740
I thought as much.

00:17:43.490 --> 00:17:44.530
My guess is...

00:17:44.950 --> 00:17:50.370
Man One has the ability to manipulate
memories and bend people to his will.

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:55.340
You had blocked off your own memories,
right?

00:17:56.120 --> 00:17:57.630
Isn't that the same ability?

00:18:03.420 --> 00:18:07.140
So you're saying he and I are related?

00:18:07.510 --> 00:18:08.520
Yeah.

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:12.310
The person who killed my father,
who took Yuna from you,

00:18:12.310 --> 00:18:16.060
and who tried to capture you...
The mastermind behind all that...

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:19.110
is probably that man.

00:18:25.030 --> 00:18:26.410
See, what did I tell you?

00:18:26.990 --> 00:18:31.160
You're right. They're using one
of those new tracking devices, huh?

00:18:31.410 --> 00:18:32.960
That's why we can't find them.

00:18:33.830 --> 00:18:36.460
The module doesn't use GPS.

00:18:36.830 --> 00:18:39.840
It pinpoints location
using only cell phone base stations.

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:42.390
It's the method
for pinpointing earthquake epicenters.

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:44.300
-What can you do?
-Don't worry.

00:18:44.590 --> 00:18:47.430
It accesses the map
when it receives an alert.

00:18:47.930 --> 00:18:49.350
See? There it is.

00:18:49.350 --> 00:18:51.400
I'll go confirm it. That's okay, right?

00:18:53.220 --> 00:18:54.230
Understood.

00:18:55.020 --> 00:18:58.110
Can you swear to me
that you won't lay a hand on him?

00:19:00.270 --> 00:19:01.740
Of course.

00:19:08.280 --> 00:19:11.700
I knew it, that dish
is this island's local specialty!

00:19:12.660 --> 00:19:16.200
Is Keith really gonna be
in a place like this, though?

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:18.460
I didn't get ahead of myself, did I?

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:22.670
Two chicken gumbos.

00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:24.010
You got it.

00:19:24.960 --> 00:19:26.680
Two gumbos, make 'em cluck!

00:19:27.420 --> 00:19:30.350
This place has the best gumbo around
these days.

00:19:31.390 --> 00:19:33.810
You still haven't told me about Man Two.

00:19:35.560 --> 00:19:37.860
That one's got nothing to do with you.

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:39.190
I want to know anyway.

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:42.070
Well, maybe you ought to know.

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:45.030
Is he the man who killed your sister?

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:48.340
Is he-

00:19:48.340 --> 00:19:49.490
He's human.

00:19:50.530 --> 00:19:51.460
He's human?

00:19:51.460 --> 00:19:54.210
Yeah, I know. It doesn't add up.

00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:58.800
If Man One is a demihuman
with brainwashing abilities,

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:01.460
it's weird that Man Two would be human.

00:20:01.460 --> 00:20:05.350
He'd just need to compel him,
so I don't get why they would partner up.

00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:10.350
So what you're saying is,
you have an idea of who Man Two is.

00:20:19.270 --> 00:20:21.020
I have my suspicions.

00:20:21.940 --> 00:20:25.030
That's why I have to make certain
for myself.

00:20:27.110 --> 00:20:29.040
All right. I'll work with you.

00:20:29.570 --> 00:20:33.950
I'll kill Man One.
I'll avenge Dr. Heath's death.

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:38.120
Tell me. Where is Yuna?

00:20:42.080 --> 00:20:44.430
They're hiding among the light
of the stars.

00:20:47.000 --> 00:20:48.810
Fly towards Canopus.

00:20:50.630 --> 00:20:51.680
Canopus?

00:20:58.890 --> 00:21:02.270
What do you think you're doing here?

00:21:02.980 --> 00:21:05.740
Er... You see... I can explain.

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:06.740
Not so fast!

00:21:10.940 --> 00:21:14.210
I tracked you down
by asking just two freaking people.

00:21:16.200 --> 00:21:19.290
Why didn't you tell me
that you knew each other?

00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:21.710
It never seemed to be the right time.

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:26.470
This is one surprise twist
we ain't gonna weasel out of with a joke.

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:28.240
Don't make this my fault!

00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:29.760
Are you two listening?

00:21:30.460 --> 00:21:31.390
Koku!

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:32.310
Yes!

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:35.470
What's going on here?
How do you know this geezer?

00:21:35.470 --> 00:21:36.930
My younger brother.

00:21:37.680 --> 00:21:40.020
I had no idea until just recently.

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:41.770
Is this true?

00:21:43.440 --> 00:21:44.440
It is.

00:21:44.850 --> 00:21:48.700
Look me in the eye and swear it.
This is the truth, right?

00:21:49.730 --> 00:21:54.030
I asked him to pick up some things.
I didn't have anyone else to turn to.

00:21:54.610 --> 00:21:57.700
Us being together is just temporary.

00:21:57.990 --> 00:22:00.370
You two don't look anything alike!

00:22:00.370 --> 00:22:05.040
We're only half brothers. I take
after my dad, but he takes after his mom.

00:22:05.920 --> 00:22:09.800
So you have another sibling besides
your sister who doesn't resemble you.

00:22:12.050 --> 00:22:15.470
Yeah, I know about her.
Boris told me everything.

00:22:16.090 --> 00:22:18.680
I saw her formula portrait
on your ceiling.

00:22:19.550 --> 00:22:22.440
So don't you dare
keep playing dumb with me.

00:22:29.060 --> 00:22:30.860
He always looks down on me.

00:22:32.320 --> 00:22:34.490
I can handle him just fine by myself.

00:22:35.700 --> 00:22:37.910
Just you watch, Minatsuki.

00:22:39.370 --> 00:22:42.710
I have a good idea
of why you might not like me.

00:22:43.160 --> 00:22:46.290
I'm short, have black hair,
am left-handed and Asian.

00:22:47.290 --> 00:22:51.050
It's because I remind you of Erika.
That's why, isn't it?

00:22:53.760 --> 00:22:56.590
If you don't want to answer, fine.

00:22:56.800 --> 00:22:57.720
But...

00:22:58.260 --> 00:23:00.680
if your end goal for all this is revenge,

00:23:00.890 --> 00:23:04.980
then as a servant of a lawful country,
I can't let you do it.

00:23:04.980 --> 00:23:05.730
Besides--

00:23:10.740 --> 00:23:13.070
What, what, what, what's going on?

00:23:15.290 --> 00:23:17.500
I can do this all by myself!

00:23:22.870 --> 00:23:24.500
What's going on?

00:23:44.310 --> 00:23:46.480
Koku?

00:23:47.480 --> 00:23:49.310
Lily, listen closely.

00:23:49.310 --> 00:23:51.900
If we survive, I'll tell you everything.
